Body:
Also affected — juggling 4-5 parallel sessions across projects is a daily need for me too, and horizontal tabs make session titles unreadable past ~4 tabs.

Note that #37273 (session sidebar alongside tabs) and #40870 (auto-scroll to top of new response) partially overlap — the underlying pain is the same: the new layout optimizes for "one active session at a time" while many users actively juggle several.

@thdxr @fwang — with users starting to migrate to alternatives (Warp mentioned above), even a small step like re-enabling the sidebar toggle beyond the 14-Sep sunset date would buy time while a proper vertical-tabs feature ships.
